msgid "Multireference CC computations"
msgstr "多参考CC计算"

msgid ""
"Internally contracted multireference internally contracted coupled-cluster "
"theory"
msgstr "内收缩多参考内收缩耦合簇理论"

msgid "Bibliography:"
msgstr "参考文献："

msgid "New ITF-based code in Molpro:"
msgstr "Molpro中新的基于ITF的代码："

msgid ""
"All publications resulting from use of the corresponding methods must "
"acknowledge the above."
msgstr "所有使用相应方法产生的出版物必须引用上述文献。"

msgid ""
"The following options may be specified on the command line (all "
"implementations):"
msgstr "以下选项可在命令行中指定（所有实现）："

msgid "Command line options for new implementation:"
msgstr "新实现的命令行选项："

msgid "Command line options for old implementation:"
msgstr "旧实现的命令行选项："

msgid ""
"``GECCO`` Required: switch for calling the external GeCCo program (see below"
" for setup)"
msgstr "``GECCO`` 必需：调用外部 GeCCo 程序的开关（设置方法见下文）"

msgid "``DUMP`` Do not execute the GeCCo program but dump interface files"
msgstr "``DUMP`` 不执行 GeCCo 程序，仅转储接口文件"

msgid "``FCIDUMP`` Dump interface files in FCIDUMP format"
msgstr "``FCIDUMP`` 以 FCIDUMP 格式转储接口文件"

msgid ""
"Orbital spaces: The usual directives of Molpro for defining the orbital "
"spaces (``CORE``, ``CLOSED``, ``OCC``)  and the symmetry and spin of the "
"reference wavefunction (``WF``) can be used. By default the definition from "
"any previous command applies. Only CAS references are supported."
msgstr ""
"轨道空间：可以使用 Molpro 定义轨道空间（\\ ``CORE``\\ 、\\ ``CLOSED``\\ 、\\ ``OCC``\\ "
"）以及参考波函数的对称性和自旋（\\ ``WF``\\ ）的常用指令。默认情况下，应用先前任何命令中的定义。仅支持 CAS 参考。"

msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "引言"

msgid "The external GeCCo program"
msgstr "外部 GeCCo 程序"

msgid "The option ``GECCO`` calls the external GeCCo program:"
msgstr "选项 ``GECCO`` 调用外部 GeCCo 程序："

msgid ""
"The ``FILE`` option allows to start arbitrary GeCCo input from Molpro (input"
" file should be located in starting directory of the Molpro computation. "
"Apart from multireference coupled-cluster theory, GeCCo also provides a "
"reasonably fast arbitrary-order single-reference coupled-cluster code "
"(closed-shell systems only). Explicitly correlated calculations can "
"currently not be directly started from Molpro."
msgstr ""
"``FILE`` 选项允许从 Molpro 启动任意的 GeCCo 输入（输入文件应位于 Molpro "
"计算的起始目录中）。除了多参考耦合簇理论，GeCCo 还提供了一个速度相当快的任意阶单参考耦合簇代码（仅限闭壳层体系）。显式相关计算目前无法直接从 "
"Molpro 启动。"

msgid "The new implementation"
msgstr "新的实现"

msgid ""
"The new implementation is based on the ITF framework. It is simply envoked "
"by"
msgstr "新的实现基于 ITF 框架。只需通过以下方式调用："

msgid ""
"which runs the code with the default settings. The singular value threshold "
"is normally not decisive for CAS(2,2) runs. We recommend to keep the "
"``relax`` option switched on (but it makes only a difference for CAS(2,2) "
"singlets at present, for triplets there is only one reference CSF)."
msgstr ""
"该命令以默认设置运行代码。奇异值阈值通常对 CAS(2,2) 计算不具决定性。我们建议保持 ``relax`` 选项开启（但目前它仅对 CAS(2,2)"
" 单重态有影响，对于三重态只有一个参考组态态函数）。"

msgid ""
"In addition, two simplified versions based on CEPA(0) or a hybrid of "
"MRCC/CEPA(0) are available:"
msgstr "此外，还提供了两种基于CEPA(0)或MRCC/CEPA(0)混合的简化版本："

